The objective part 5 is some text that varies. The objective part 5 is "ead east. With that accomplished, make an attempt to go to the north. After that, try to take a trip west. With that accomplished, attempt to take a trip north. Next, make an attempt to go east. After".
The objective part 6 is some text that varies. The objective part 6 is " that, make an effort to go north. And then, go east. Then, make an attempt to move north. Then, make an effort to move west. Okay, and then, make an effort to venture south. With that done, go east. ".
